- content_for(:title, "Privacy Policy")
- link_opts = {rel: "noopener", target: "_blank", class: "text-foreground hover:underline"}

.py-6.space-y-6
  div
    h1.text-2xl.font-bold.tracking-tight Privacy Policy
    p.text-muted-foreground
      | Effective date: 2025-03-01

  section.space-y-2
    h2.text-lg.font-semibold What this app does
    p.text-sm.leading-6.text-muted-foreground
      | TaiwanCards is a free, ad-free web app for learning Taiwanese Mandarin. It provides flashcards with
      | spaced repetition, dictionary lookups, pronunciation practice and vocabulary lists. It is run by one
      | independent developer, not by a company.

  section.space-y-2
    h2.text-lg.font-semibold What we store
    ul.list-disc.space-y-1.pl-5.text-sm.leading-6.text-muted-foreground
      li Your email address, display name and interface language.
      li A password hash, if you registered with a password rather than with Google.
      li Your study data: decks, cards, review history, progress and practice settings.
      li Pronunciation attempts and the measurements derived from them.
      li Server logs of requests, kept for reliability and abuse prevention.

  section.space-y-2
    h2.text-lg.font-semibold What we do not do
    ul.list-disc.space-y-1.pl-5.text-sm.leading-6.text-muted-foreground
      li We do not sell or rent personal data.
      li We do not show advertising and we do not run advertising trackers.
      li We do not use third-party analytics.
      li We do not profile you for anything other than showing you your own progress.

  section.space-y-2
    h2.text-lg.font-semibold Cookies
    p.text-sm.leading-6.text-muted-foreground
      | Two cookies are used, both strictly necessary: a signed session cookie that keeps you logged in,
      | and a cookie remembering your interface language. There are no advertising or tracking cookies.

  - if Donate.offered?
    section.space-y-2
      h2.text-lg.font-semibold Donation button
      p.text-sm.leading-6.text-muted-foreground
        | The help page carries an optional donation button supplied by Buy Me a Coffee. Opening that one page
        | loads their script, so your browser contacts them and they see your IP address and user agent. No
        | account data is sent, the button appears on no other page, and donating is never required.

  section#google-data.space-y-3 class="scroll-mt-16"
    h2.text-lg.font-semibold = t("privacy_google.heading")
    p.text-sm.leading-6.text-muted-foreground = t("privacy_google.body")
    ul.space-y-2
      - %w[signin drive limits].each do |key|
        li.flex.items-start.gap-2.text-sm.leading-6
          span.mt-2.size-1 class="shrink-0 rounded-full bg-foreground"
          span = t("privacy_google.#{key}")
    p.text-sm.leading-6.text-muted-foreground
      | Our use of information received from Google APIs follows the
      =< link_to "Google API Services User Data Policy", "https://developers.google.com/terms/api-services-user-data-policy", link_opts
      |  and its Limited Use requirements. Google account data is never used for advertising, never sold,
      | and never shared beyond what is described here.

  section.space-y-2
    h2.text-lg.font-semibold Where data is held
    p.text-sm.leading-6.text-muted-foreground
      | The application and its database run on Render in Singapore. Traffic passes through Cloudflare, and
      | audio files are served from Cloudflare R2. These providers process data only in order to host the
      | service. If you use the Google Drive backup, that copy sits in your own Google account.

  section.space-y-2
    h2.text-lg.font-semibold Retention and deletion
    p.text-sm.leading-6.text-muted-foreground
      | Your data is kept while your account exists. Write to the address below to have the account and
      | everything in it deleted; server logs age out on their own. Deleting your account here does not
      | touch a backup file you created on your own Google Drive — that file is yours to delete.

  section.space-y-2
    h2.text-lg.font-semibold Your choices
    ul.list-disc.space-y-1.pl-5.text-sm.leading-6.text-muted-foreground
      li Register with an email address and password, in which case no Google data is requested at all.
      li Revoke the app's Google access at any time from your Google account permissions page.
      li Ask for a copy of your data, a correction, or full deletion.

  section.space-y-2
    h2.text-lg.font-semibold Children
    p.text-sm.leading-6.text-muted-foreground
      | The app is not directed at children under 13, and accounts are not knowingly created for them.

  section.space-y-2
    h2.text-lg.font-semibold Changes
    p.text-sm.leading-6.text-muted-foreground
      | If this policy changes, the effective date above changes with it.

  section.space-y-2
    h2.text-lg.font-semibold Contact
    p.text-sm.leading-6.text-muted-foreground
      | Questions, data requests and deletion requests:
      =< mail_to "taiwancards@pm.me", "taiwancards@pm.me", class: "text-foreground hover:underline"

  section.space-y-2
    h2.text-lg.font-semibold Related links
    p.text-sm.leading-6
      = link_to "Terms of Service", terms_path, class: "text-foreground hover:underline"
      |  ·
      =< link_to "Licenses", licenses_path, class: "text-foreground hover:underline"
